.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt SYSCONF 3
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm sysconf
.Nm ARG_MAX
.Nm NGROUPS_MAX
.Nd query system limits
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In unistd.h
.Ft long
.Fn sysconf "int name"
.In limits.h
.Va ARG_MAX
.Va NGROUPS_MAX
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn sysconf returns a system limit or option value. ARG_MAX and NGROUPS_MAX are the fixed
limits visible to programs.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn sysconf returns the value or -1 when the name is unknown.
.Sh ERRORS
.Er EINVAL is returned for an unknown name; .Fn sysconf does not set errno for every query.
.Sh STANDARDS
POSIX.1-2024; ring 0.
.Sh CAVEATS
The fixed numbers are ARG_MAX 131072, NGROUPS_MAX 1023 and HOST_NAME_MAX 64. See H-19.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr sysconf 3
.Xr limits 7
.Xr libc 7
